# Upstream OpenWrt 25.12.6 prebuilt binary packages (aarch64_generic).
#
# Signed with OpenWrt's release key at /etc/apk/keys/openwrt-25.12.pem.
# Provides the full OpenWrt package set -- incl. telephony, which our own
# feeds do not build -- without rebuilding anything ourselves.
#
# Do NOT add an upstream targets/ feed: the kernel and all kmod-* packages
# are vermagic-locked to our custom 6.12.94 build and come only from our
# targets feed (distfeeds.list). An upstream kernel has a different vermagic
# hash and would break every kmod.
https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/25.12.6/packages/aarch64_generic/base/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/25.12.6/packages/aarch64_generic/luci/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/25.12.6/packages/aarch64_generic/packages/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/25.12.6/packages/aarch64_generic/routing/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/25.12.6/packages/aarch64_generic/telephony/packages.adb
https://downloads.openwrt.org/releases/25.12.6/packages/aarch64_generic/video/packages.adb
